Title: THE BLOOMING
Credit: Interactive Game Screenplay
Author: Group 24
Draft date: 2026
Contact:
Genre: 2D Point-and-Click Psychological Horror

# GAME STRUCTURE

Game Type: 2D Point-and-Click Psychological Horror

Player Character: ELIAS

Core Mechanics:
- Point-and-click navigation
- Environmental inspection
- Dialogue interaction
- Inventory collection
- Inventory item usage
- Document reading
- Puzzle solving
- Journal and objective tracking
- Sanity system
- Event-driven horror sequences


# SEQUENCE 01 - FIRST DAY


EXT. BLACKWOOD BOTANICAL RESEARCH FACILITY - MORNING

FADE IN:

A remote botanical research facility surrounded by dense forest.

Morning mist moves between the trees.

Rainwater drips from the facility roof.

SFX: DISTANT BIRDS.

SFX: LIGHT WIND.

SFX: WATER DRIPPING.

ELIAS HART, a young junior botanist, stands outside the main entrance.

DR. MARA VALE, a senior botanist, waits beside the security door.

MARA
You must be Elias.

ELIAS
Dr. Vale?

MARA
Mara is fine.

MARA
You found the place without getting lost.
That's already better than our last intern.

ELIAS
I'm not an intern.

MARA
Then you'll have even fewer excuses.

Mara turns and walks toward the facility entrance.

She stops beside the security door.

MARA
Come on.

MARA
I'll show you around.


[[PLAYER CONTROL ENABLED]]


[[OBJECTIVE: FOLLOW DR. VALE]]


The player may now inspect the environment.

Available hotspots:

[[HOTSPOT: FACILITY SIGN]]

[[HOTSPOT: SECURITY DOOR]]

[[HOTSPOT: INTERCOM]]

[[HOTSPOT: DR. MARA VALE]]


# OPTIONAL INTERACTION - FACILITY SIGN


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK FACILITY SIGN]]


The camera moves closer to the sign.

BLACKWOOD BOTANICAL RESEARCH FACILITY

AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY


ELIAS
Blackwood Research Facility.

ELIAS
A long way from the university greenhouse.


[[RETURN PLAYER CONTROL]]


# OPTIONAL INTERACTION - INTERCOM


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK INTERCOM]]


ELIAS
Security intercom.

MARA
Hopefully you won't need it.

ELIAS
Hopefully?

MARA
Hopefully.


[[RETURN PLAYER CONTROL]]


# MAIN INTERACTION - SECURITY DOOR


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK SECURITY DOOR]]


Elias approaches the door.

The player attempts to open it.

SFX: ACCESS DENIED BEEP.

The indicator turns red.


ELIAS
Locked.

MARA
Yes.

MARA
That tends to happen with security doors.

Mara removes an access card from her pocket and holds it toward Elias.


MARA
Here.

MARA
Take this.


[[INTERACTIVE OBJECT ENABLED: ACCESS CARD]]


The player must click the access card.


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK ACCESS CARD]]


SFX: ITEM ACQUIRED.

The access card moves into the inventory bar.


[[ITEM ACQUIRED: LEVEL-1 ACCESS CARD]]


ELIAS
My access card?

MARA
Level One.

MARA
Greenhouse, staff office, archive corridor.

ELIAS
And the other rooms?

MARA
Not your concern.

A short pause.

MARA
Select the card from your equipment.

MARA
Then use it on the security panel beside the door.


[[PLAYER CONTROL ENABLED]]


# WRONG ACTION BRANCH


[[BRANCH: PLAYER CLICKS DOOR WITHOUT SELECTING CARD]]


SFX: ACCESS DENIED.

ELIAS
Still locked.

MARA
Card first, Elias.

MARA
Panel second.


[[RETURN PLAYER CONTROL]]


# CORRECT ACTION


[[PLAYER ACTION: SELECT ACCESS CARD]]

[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK SECURITY PANEL]]


Elias scans the access card.

SFX: CARD SCAN.

The security indicator changes from red to green.

SFX: ACCESS GRANTED.

SFX: AUTOMATIC DOOR OPENING.


MARA
There you go.

MARA
You'll use equipment the same way.

MARA
Choose what you need...

MARA
...then use it where it belongs.


[[OBJECTIVE COMPLETE: ENTER THE FACILITY]]


MARA
After you.


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK OPEN ENTRANCE]]


FADE OUT.


# SEQUENCE 02 - FACILITY ORIENTATION


INT. BLACKWOOD FACILITY - MAIN CORRIDOR - MORNING

FADE IN:

A narrow research corridor.

Fluorescent lights hum overhead.

Three important doors are visible.

STAFF OFFICE.

GREENHOUSE.

RESTRICTED LABORATORY.

Mara walks slowly ahead of Elias.


MARA
The greenhouse is at the end of the corridor.

MARA
My office is on the left.

MARA
Storage is opposite it.


[[PLAYER CONTROL ENABLED]]

[[OBJECTIVE: FOLLOW DR. VALE TO THE GREENHOUSE]]


The player may follow Mara or inspect the corridor.


# OPTIONAL INTERACTION - RESTRICTED LABORATORY


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK RESTRICTED LABORATORY DOOR]]


Elias approaches the door.

The security indicator is red.


ELIAS
Restricted Laboratory.

MARA
Not part of today's tour.

ELIAS
What's inside?

MARA
Projects above your clearance level.

ELIAS
Dangerous projects?

MARA
Expensive projects.

A pause.

MARA
Come on.

MARA
Your specimen is waiting.


[[RETURN PLAYER CONTROL]]


# GREENHOUSE ENTRANCE


[[PLAYER ACTION: APPROACH MARA]]


Mara stands beside the greenhouse entrance.


MARA
Before we go inside, one rule.

ELIAS
Only one?

MARA
Don't remove anything from the greenhouse
without authorization.

ELIAS
Understood.

MARA
And don't move any specimen unless you're told.

ELIAS
That's two rules.

MARA
You're observant.

MARA
Good start.

Mara scans her access card.

SFX: CARD SCAN.

SFX: ACCESS GRANTED.

The greenhouse door opens.


MARA
After you.


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK GREENHOUSE ENTRANCE]]


FADE OUT.


# SEQUENCE 03 - GREENHOUSE ORIENTATION


INT. RESEARCH GREENHOUSE - MORNING

FADE IN:

Warm sunlight passes through the glass greenhouse roof.

Rows of plants fill the room.

Water droplets fall from irrigation pipes.

Small pollen particles float through the sunlight.

BGM: SOFT GREENHOUSE AMBIENCE.

SFX: WATER DRIPPING.

SFX: DISTANT BIRDS.

VFX: FLOATING POLLEN PARTICLES.


[[PLAYER CONTROL ENABLED]]


Mara remains near the entrance.


MARA
Go ahead.

ELIAS
Go ahead with what?

MARA
Look around.

MARA
If you're going to work here,
learn where everything is.


[[OBJECTIVE: EXPLORE THE GREENHOUSE]]


Available hotspots:

[[HOTSPOT: WATERING CAN]]

[[HOTSPOT: FILTERED WATER SINK]]

[[HOTSPOT: CARE INSTRUCTION CLIPBOARD]]

[[HOTSPOT: GREENHOUSE THERMOMETER]]

[[HOTSPOT: STORAGE CABINET]]

[[HOTSPOT: OLD RESEARCH JOURNAL]]

[[HOTSPOT: SPECIMEN X-17]]

[[HOTSPOT: DR. MARA VALE]]


# INTERACTION - FILTERED WATER SINK


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK FILTERED WATER SINK]]


ELIAS
Filtered water system?

MARA
Yes.

MARA
Specimens in this section don't receive water
directly from the main supply.

ELIAS
Why?

MARA
Because contamination ruins research.

A beat.

MARA
And careers.


[[RETURN PLAYER CONTROL]]


# INTERACTION - WATERING CAN


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK WATERING CAN]]


ELIAS
Standard watering can.

MARA
Take it.

ELIAS
Now?

MARA
Unless you're planning to carry water
in your hands.


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK WATERING CAN AGAIN]]


SFX: ITEM ACQUIRED.


[[ITEM ACQUIRED: EMPTY WATERING CAN]]


MARA
Good.

MARA
You know how to pick things up.

ELIAS
I did graduate from university.

MARA
We'll see how useful that was.


[[RETURN PLAYER CONTROL]]


# INTERACTION - OLD RESEARCH JOURNAL


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK OLD RESEARCH JOURNAL]]


Elias approaches an old journal lying on a table.


ELIAS
Whose journal is this?

Mara immediately turns toward Elias.


MARA
Leave that.

ELIAS
Why?

Mara walks toward the table and closes the journal.


MARA
Old research notes.

ELIAS
From X-17?

MARA
I said leave it.


[[HOTSPOT DISABLED: OLD RESEARCH JOURNAL]]


Mara walks toward the central specimen table.


MARA
Come here.

MARA
There's something you need to see.


[[OBJECTIVE UPDATED: MEET DR. VALE AT THE SPECIMEN TABLE]]


# SEQUENCE 04 - FIRST MEETING WITH X-17


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK MARA OR SPECIMEN TABLE]]


Elias approaches Mara.

On the table is a small black flowerpot.

A pale, closed flower bud grows from the soil.

A label reads:

SPECIMEN X-17


MARA
This is why you're here.

ELIAS
That's it?

MARA
Disappointed?

ELIAS
A little.

MARA
Specimen X-17.

MARA
Recovered three weeks ago from an
undocumented forest region.

ELIAS
Species?

MARA
Unknown.

ELIAS
Genus?

MARA
Unknown.

ELIAS
Family?

Mara looks at Elias.

MARA
If we knew that, Elias,
we wouldn't need you.


[[DIALOGUE CHOICE]]


+ [IT LOOKS DANGEROUS.]

    ELIAS
    I expected something more dangerous.

    Mara looks at the flower.

    MARA
    Appearances are unreliable.

    [[SET FLAG: FIRST_IMPRESSION = DANGEROUS]]


+ [IT'S BEAUTIFUL.]

    ELIAS
    It's beautiful.

    MARA
    Careful with that word.

    [[SET FLAG: FIRST_IMPRESSION = BEAUTIFUL]]


+ [IT LOOKS UNUSUAL.]

    ELIAS
    It looks unusual.

    MARA
    Give it time.

    [[SET FLAG: FIRST_IMPRESSION = UNUSUAL]]


# SEQUENCE 05 - OBSERVATION TUTORIAL


MARA
Before you do anything...

MARA
Inspect it.

ELIAS
What am I looking for?

MARA
You tell me.


[[OBSERVATION MODE ENABLED]]


Available inspection points:

[[INSPECTION POINT: PETALS]]

[[INSPECTION POINT: STEM]]

[[INSPECTION POINT: SOIL]]


# INSPECT PETALS


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK PETALS]]


The camera zooms toward the flower petals.


ELIAS
Closed petals.

ELIAS
Pale coloration.

ELIAS
No visible physical damage.

MARA
They were open three days ago.

MARA
