I could.

A beat.

MARA
But you'll remember more if you look it up yourself.


[[OBJECTIVE UPDATED: READ X-17 CARE INSTRUCTIONS]]


# CARE INSTRUCTION DOCUMENT


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK CARE INSTRUCTION CLIPBOARD]]


The document interface opens.


SPECIMEN X-17

DAILY CARE PROCEDURE

1. Confirm greenhouse temperature: 23-25 degrees Celsius.

2. Inspect specimen for physical abnormalities.

3. Provide 500 ml filtered water.

4. Record unusual reactions.

5. Do not relocate the specimen.


ELIAS
Five hundred milliliters.

MARA
Good.

MARA
Now you know why we write things down.


[[DOCUMENT INTERFACE CLOSES]]

[[OBJECTIVE UPDATED: FILL WATERING CAN WITH 500 ML WATER]]


