# SEQUENCE 07 - WATERING X-17


MARA
Now water the specimen.


[[OBJECTIVE: WATER X-17]]


[[PLAYER ACTION: SELECT WATERING CAN - 500 ML]]

[[PLAYER ACTION: USE ON X-17]]


Elias carefully waters the plant.

SFX: WATER POURING.

Mara observes.


MARA
Slowly.

The watering finishes.


[[ITEM UPDATED: EMPTY WATERING CAN]]

[[OBJECTIVE COMPLETE: WATER X-17]]


Nothing happens.

Elias looks at the flower.


ELIAS
That's it?

MARA
What were you expecting?

ELIAS
I don't know.

MARA
That's research.


SFX: RADIO STATIC.


RADIO VOICE
Dr. Vale.

RADIO VOICE
Report to Lab Two immediately.

Mara's expression changes.


MARA
I'm coming.

She turns toward Elias.


MARA
Finish the observation record.

MARA
Then leave.

ELIAS
You're leaving me here?

MARA
It's a greenhouse, Elias.

Mara looks at X-17.

A short pause.


MARA
What could happen?

Mara walks toward the greenhouse exit.

Before leaving, she stops.


MARA
Elias.

ELIAS
Yeah?

MARA
If you hear anything unusual--

She stops herself.


ELIAS
What?

MARA
Nothing.

MARA
Finish your work.

Mara exits.

SFX: GREENHOUSE DOOR CLOSES.

SFX: ELECTRONIC LOCK.

The greenhouse ambience becomes quieter.


[[GUIDE CHARACTER REMOVED]]

[[PLAYER CONTROL ENABLED]]

[[OBJECTIVE: COMPLETE THE OBSERVATION RECORD]]


# SEQUENCE 08 - FIRST SUPERNATURAL EVENT


The player must inspect X-17 again.


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK X-17]]


Observation mode opens.


[[INSPECTION POINT: PETALS]]

[[INSPECTION POINT: STEM]]

[[INSPECTION POINT: ROOT AREA]]


# PETAL EVENT


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK PETALS]]


ELIAS
No visible change in--

The petal moves.

Elias stops speaking.

Silence.


ELIAS
...What?


[[DIALOGUE CHOICE]]


+ [INSPECT AGAIN]

    The camera moves closer to the flower.

    Nothing happens.

    ELIAS
    Probably water movement.

    [[SET FLAG: REACTION = INVESTIGATE]]


+ [IGNORE IT]

    Elias moves away from the flower.

    ELIAS
    Probably nothing.

    [[SET FLAG: REACTION = IGNORE]]


[[OBSERVATION MODE CLOSES]]


Silence.

Two seconds pass.

The flower begins to glow.


VFX: PETAL GLOW EFFECT.

VFX: POLLEN PARTICLES INCREASE.

SFX: LOW ETHEREAL HUM.


ELIAS
What the hell?


[[OBJECTIVE UPDATED: INVESTIGATE THE CHANGE IN X-17]]


[[PLAYER CONTROL ENABLED]]


# MAIN HORROR TRIGGER


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK GLOWING X-17]]


Elias approaches the flower.

The glow pulses once.

Silence.


PLANT
(whispering)
Elias.

Elias immediately steps backward.


ELIAS
...Mara?

No response.


PLANT
(whispering)
Elias...


VFX: SCREEN DISTORTION - 0.3 SECONDS.

SFX: LOW HEARTBEAT.


[[PLAYER CONTROL ENABLED]]


Available reactions:

[[HOTSPOT: INTERCOM]]

[[HOTSPOT: GREENHOUSE EXIT]]

[[HOTSPOT: X-17]]


