[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK INTERCOM]]


Elias activates the intercom.


ELIAS
Dr. Vale?

SFX: RADIO STATIC.


ELIAS
Mara, are you there?

Static continues.

Then a faint voice emerges through the speaker.


PLANT
(through intercom)
I'm here.

