SFX: ELECTRICAL CLICK.


ELIAS
No.


[[SET FLAG: FIRST_HORROR_RESPONSE = INTERCOM]]

[[CONTINUE TO SCENE EXIT]]


# BRANCH B - ATTEMPT TO LEAVE


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK GREENHOUSE EXIT]]


Elias walks quickly toward the door.


PLANT
(whispering)
Don't go.

Elias stops.

The greenhouse lights flicker.

VFX: LIGHT FLICKER.

SFX: ELECTRICAL BUZZ.


ELIAS
Who's there?


[[SET FLAG: FIRST_HORROR_RESPONSE = ESCAPE]]

[[CONTINUE TO SCENE EXIT]]


# BRANCH C - APPROACH THE FLOWER


[[PLAYER ACTION: CLICK X-17 AGAIN]]


Elias slowly approaches the flower.


ELIAS
Did you...

A long pause.


ELIAS
No.

The glow disappears.


ELIAS
I'm talking to a plant.


[[SET FLAG: FIRST_HORROR_RESPONSE = FLOWER]]

[[CONTINUE TO SCENE EXIT]]


# SEQUENCE 09 - SCENE 1 EXIT


[[OBJECTIVE UPDATED: LEAVE THE GREENHOUSE]]


The player walks toward the greenhouse exit.


[[PLAYER ACTION: USE ACCESS CARD ON EXIT PANEL]]


SFX: CARD SCAN.

SFX: ACCESS GRANTED.

The door opens.

Elias enters the corridor.

The greenhouse door closes behind him.

SFX: DOOR CLOSE.

Silence.

Elias begins walking away.

SFX: SOFT KNOCK.

Elias stops.

He turns toward the greenhouse.

Silence.

Another knock.

SFX: KNOCK.

Elias slowly approaches the greenhouse window.

Through the glass, X-17 remains inside its flowerpot.

Everything appears normal.

Then Elias notices something.

A thin root extends from the flowerpot.

It reaches across the greenhouse floor.

The root is touching the inside of the greenhouse door.

SFX: LOW HORROR STINGER.

Elias stares at it.

CUT TO BLACK.


TITLE CARD:

END OF DAY 1


SFX: DISTANT WHISPER.


PLANT
(whispering)
Elias...


FADE OUT.


# END OF SCENE 1
